[gd_scene load_steps=17 format=3 uid="uid://byond26oht575"]

; The layers of the menu, from the bottom up: the dark plate the panorama lies on (the
; picture is wider than the window is high, so it keeps its shape and leaves a band
; above and below), the panorama itself, the moving highlights and the smoke over it,
; the veil that keeps the items readable on the picture, the vignette, the name of the
; game and the items themselves.

